# TaskFlow development guidelines (adapted from the DZ2 approach)
- Keep frontend code in React + TypeScript, with explicit Task types.
- Preserve verified backend behavior; inspect OpenAPI before changing integration.
- Do not introduce unsupported DTO fields or authentication screens.
- Write component tests for validation, status changes, and error states.
- Maintain responsive 375px and desktop views.
- Run npm test and npm run build after changes.
- Do not claim checks passed without execution logs.
